>
  <h2>What this is</h2>
  <p>
    Sleep is the single highest-leverage intervention in the entire 4M framework.
    It governs hormone regulation, inflammatory clearance, cognitive consolidation,
    and emotional resilience. Men aged 35-60 are particularly prone to progressive
    sleep debt — often masked by caffeine and routine.
  </p>
  <p>
    We address sleep as a system, not a single behavior. That means auditing your
    circadian environment, sleep architecture, and recovery signals before layering
    in any protocol or supplement.
  </p>

  <h2>Our approach</h2>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Sleep Audit</h3>
      <p>Structured intake covering chronotype, bedroom environment, and sleep-disrupting habits.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Circadian Anchoring</h3>
      <p>Morning light exposure + consistent wake time reset your master clock faster than any supplement.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
